OL,3,ABarclays workers ask for more money to
OL,4,Areturn to the office
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of Barclays staff are
OL,7,Fdemanding concessions from the bank
OL,8,Fafter it said it wants employees to
OL,9,Fwork from the office more often.
OL,11,FStaff who have been expected to work in
OL,12,Fthe office for two days per week should
OL,13,Fbe in the office for at least three
OL,14,Fdays a week from next month, according
OL,15,Fto the company.
OL,17,FUnite, which represents about 36,000
OL,18,FBarclays staff, is calling for the bank
OL,19,Fto reverse its decision. The union is
OL,20,Falso pressing for exemptions and a
OL,21,Fpayment to offset increased travel and
OL,22,Fchildcare costs.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,108,105,200,300,0,100
