OL,3,ABarclays workers ask for more money to
OL,4,Areturn to the office
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarclays said many employees already
OL,7,Fwork in the office for three or more
OL,8,Fdays and that being on-site fostered
OL,9,Fcollaboration and helped people learn
OL,10,Ffrom each other.
